<p>ran me jab sheh ki taraf se hurr-e- dee'ndar aaya<br />
kis bashashat se udaataa huwa rehwaar aaya<br />
ghul huwa syed-e-mazloom ka ghamqaar aaya<br />
jaa'n nisaare qalafe hyder-e karrar aaya</p>

<p>tattaqe noor sare raah nazar aata hai<br />
jalwa-e qudrat-e allah nazar aata hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye suqan sunke pukara pisar-e saad-e shareer<br />
haan tarafdaar-e shah-e dee'n pa chale naiza-o- teer<br />
leke harbou'n ko badha fouj ka amboh kaseer<br />
fateha padh ke jawa'n mard ne khainchi shamsheer</p>

<p>hur ka mu surq huwa fouj-e- sitam zard huwi<br />
shola-e- tegh se bijli ki chamak gard huwi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>badh ke farmate the abbas zahe izzat-o- jaah<br />
baarek allah ki deta tha sada dilbar-e shah<br />
kahte the ibn-e- hasan waah hur-e-ghaazi waah<br />
shah har zarb pa farmate the mashallah</p>

<p>apni jaa'n-baazi ka ghaazi jo silaa paata tha<br />
muskurata huwa tasleem ko jhuk jaata tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haif jhukne me layeenou ne jo fursat paayi<br />
saamna chod ke sab fouj aqab se aayi<br />
laakh qoo'n rez idhar aur udhar tanhaayi<br />
baag ghode ki phiraata tha ke barchi khaayi</p>

<p>aagaya maut ke panje me na kuch der lagi<br />
farq par gurz laga dosh pa shamsheer lagi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>seena ghurbaal huwa teer chale aadaa ke<br />
rakhdiya sher ne qarbooz pa sar nyoda ke<br />
ali akbar ne ye hazrat se kaha chilla ke<br />
gar ho irshaad to mehmaa'n ko bachaau'n jaake</p>

<p>qaadim-e- hazrate zehra-o- ali girta hai<br />
qaak par ab wo saeed-e- azali girta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shaah rone lage ye sunte hi mehmaa'n ki qabar<br />
hogayi aansuou'n se resh-e- mubarak sab tar<br />
ali akbar se kaha tum abhi tehro dilbar<br />
hur ki imdaad ko ham jaayenge aye noor -e nazar</p>

<p>kis se is waqt kahu mai jo qalaq mujh par hai<br />
laash uthaaunga ke mehmaan ka haq mujh par hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye suqan keh ke chale ran ko janab-e- shabbir<br />
waa'n gira qaak pa ghode se hur-e- ba touqeer<br />
dekh kar shaah ko aate huwe bhaage be peer<br />
pohnche laashe pa imam-e- do jahan waqte aqeer</p>

<p>chaman-e- hasti-e- mehma'an ko ujadte dekha<br />
qaak pa ediyaa'n zaqmi ko ragadte dekha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>girke laashe ke baraabar ye pukaare sarwar<br />
mera mehmaa'n-o- madadgaar-o- moin-o- yaawar<br />
gurz kya tujhko laga toot gayi meri kamar<br />
girpada ghode se aur aah na ki hamko qabar</p>

<p>dost ke hijr me kab dost ko chain aaya hai<br />
kholde chashm ko bhai, ke hussain aaya hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>neem waah chashm se hur ne ruq-e- moula dekha<br />
zeere sar zanu-e-shabbir ka takiya dekha<br />
muskura kar taraf-e- aalam-e-baala dekha<br />
sheh ne farmaya ke aye hur-e- jari kya dekha</p>

<p>arz ki husn-e ruq-e hoor nazar aata hai<br />
farsh se arsh talak noor nazar aata hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mujh ko lene chale aate hai farishte ya shaah<br />
malakul maut bhi karta hai mohabbat ki nigaah<br />
quld se sher-e-khuda nikle hai allah allah<br />
lo baramad huwe shabbar bhi pidar ke hamraah</p>

<p>nange sar ahmed-e- muqtar ki pyari aayi<br />
dekhiye aap ke nana ki sawaari aai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehke ye godh me shabbir ke li angdaayi<br />
aaya maathe pa araq chahre pa zardi chaayi<br />
sheh ne farmaya hame chod chale kyu bhai<br />
chal base hur-e- jari phir na kuch aawaz aayi</p>

<p>taair-e rooh ne parwaaz ki toobaa ki taraf<br />
putliyaa'n rehgayi phir kar shah-e- wala ki taraf<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roke akbar ne kaha hur-e-dilawar hai hai<br />
aye madadgaare jigar bande payambar hai hai<br />
qoo'n me sab tar hai tera roohe munawwar hai hai<br />
tashna-o bekas-o mazloom ke yaawar hai hai</p>

<p>idhar aana tha ke teri ajal aayi bhai<br />
ghar me sadaat ke dawat bhi na khaayi bhaai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>